  "version": "0.5.5-beta.8",
  "notes": "## Changes since `v0.5.5-beta.7`\n\n### Fixes\n\n- show Codex, OpenCode or pi at work again as soon as their wait is answered, since Codex runs no hook between the approval and the end of the approved tool, which left the tab paused for as long as the command ran: typing in the waiting terminal now resumes the spinner, and a refusal is put right by the agent's own report, which Claude Code does not send, so its waits are left as they were ([5864ca10](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/5864ca107f637679eb7c8de9bc921b29183783c0))\n- keep the tab's spinner while Codex, OpenCode or pi works on after Esc or Ctrl+C, since Codex's Esc closes a popup first and its Ctrl+C clears a draft without stopping anything, which cleared the spinner for the rest of the turn: these agents report a real stop themselves, so only Claude Code's is still guessed from the keys ([2a165f78](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/2a165f78ba3436e704e2e4418baf2a1c399b23a0))\n\n**Full comparison:** [v0.5.5-beta.7...v0.5.5-beta.8](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/compare/v0.5.5-beta.7...v0.5.5-beta.8)",
